event_inherited();
obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"My ex wife recently won in the court for fucking alimony and emotional damages.
	[/page]Absolutely fantastic.
	[/page]I’m barely getting paid above minimum wage ——
	[/page]I have literally nothing, and they’re letting her take half of that nothing.
	[/page]I will never recover financially from this.
	[/page]The lawyer fees already put me in debt, my credit has gone to shit,
	[/page]the bank’s not letting me borrow money, and the beer and cheese in my fridge are running real low.
	[/page]I’m trying to figure out right now if I can make it into the next month.
	[/page]If not, I’ll probably shoot myself.
	", 
	"Mr. Chen", spr_mr_chen_portrait_gun
);
obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"You tell him that you may have an offer that may help his situation.");
obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"I highly doubt it, but I’ll humor you.
	[/page]What is it?
	", 
	"Mr. Chen", spr_mr_chen_portrait_gun
);
obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"You tell him that you’ll buy the bullets for an exorbitant price.");
obj_scribble.textbox(
	"...oh?.", 
	"Mr. Chen", spr_mr_chen_portrait_gun
);
obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	@"You tell him that you need the bullets for a project,
	[\page]but you can’t purchase them legally because you’re a minor.
	");

obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"So you need another way to get them. Makes sense.
	[/page]Well, I think I would need...
	[/page]500 bucks from you.
	[/page]Yeah, that’s how much I need so I don’t starve next month.
	[/page]You think you could get that much cash, kid?
	", 
	"Mr. Chen", spr_mr_chen_portrait_gun
);
obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"You tell him that you’ll try.");
